Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on a move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the mighty Pharaoh now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.63,0:01:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,barely standing beside the ruins\Nof what was once his kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not over. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a light that still burns bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The light of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as it exists,\Nyou will never prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends have\Nsurrendered to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soldiers have deserted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you speak of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.33,0:01:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in your darkest hour,\Nyou refuse to give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How nauseatingly human of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign is over. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:02:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Centuries ago, you possessed\Nthe power to lock me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you seem to have\Ngotten weak in your own days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.49,0:02:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I can't stop him without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.87,0:02:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have stayed in\Nyour own world, mortals!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your souls belong to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's help the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.73,0:02:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,First the Lord of\NDarkness, now these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.23,0:03:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, any last-minute plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I always say, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,When in doubt, put your faith\Nin the heart of the cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the deck the\NPharaoh and I built together,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can blast this creep\Nback to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a saying back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a vow to protect you at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not going\Nin there alone, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I play!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My super robo-yaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, fire sorcerer. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got company, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Magician, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Help him out, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferno Fire Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Sorcerer, your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Super Roboyaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They're back! Ah, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use. These dudes\Nwon't stay down, so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,what are we supposed to\Ndo perhaps I can help
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Start magician girl, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well someone must have summoned her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling I know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, master? Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of you must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So leave these demons to us. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers of Zork! Be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh! You all right? It's us, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd return. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have you back to\Nyour old self in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:05:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you thinking what I am? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.35,0:06:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are finished, then allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.13,0:06:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, were you able to locate my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,These humans may have found the\Nlocation of your real name, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,However, they were unable\Nto read it. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The word in question is written\Nin a language unfamiliar to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true we made it through your tomb and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,there it was on the back\Nwall there was only one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,problem your name was carved in ancient
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,egyptian hieroglyphics i\Nknow what it looked like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:07:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,i just don't know how\Nto say it all right guys
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,name or no name we got\Nsome butt to kick Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.99,0:07:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferno Fire Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Robo Yarrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for your pathetic dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, but this is a little\Nmore painful than dueling back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, what makes you say that, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that we're all\Ndoubled over in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look now, but our\Nfriends are back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.53,0:08:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the future depends on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what to do. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you fools not learned that I am\Nimpervious to all attacks, including yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We just blasted him with\Nall of our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.31,0:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How right you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now surrender your spirits to the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.01,0:09:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you will defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, your friends shall vanish\Ninto the darkness one soul at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out a way to\Ntell the Pharaoh what his name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And we don't exactly have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can save you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender to the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Zork, we're never gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna help the Pharaoh\Nfigure out his name so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,he can lock you away just\Nlike he did the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, I want you to have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? It's a cartouche.\NWhenever you get your memory back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.17,0:10:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you can engrave your real name\Non there then you won't forget it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,again hey guys i realized how\Nwe can help the pharaoh how easy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,all we have to do is concentrate\Nhuh i bet if we think about those
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,symbols hard enough we can make\Nthe pharaoh's name appear on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that cartouche she's right remember\Nhow we were able to fly here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just by concentrating exactly.\NNow we all have to think about the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh's name. I'm in. Yeah, me\Nthree now focus on those symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been a nuisance\Nto me for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's working. Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.19,0:11:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta remember those symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.03,0:11:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tharo's name, appear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid once again\Nyou're too late, humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you read the symbols?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do you know what your name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my ancient name has been revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.41,0:12:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am King Atim!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You now possess the power to\Ndefeat the Dark One, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,By calling forth the light of the three\NEgyptian gods to swallow the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, mighty gods of\NEgypt, I revive thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they'll win this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.89,0:13:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the pharaoh knows what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian gods are\Npowerless against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You already tried this and failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but there's something\NI didn't do last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Merge them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I give you the creator\Nof light! What? Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness, be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take you with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss again, sork!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't so bad. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,other than the tornado damage,\Nrandom lightning explosions,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and poisonous acid rain,\Nit was a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the storm is lighting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.07,0:14:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.63,0:15:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all we have to do is find Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Shot Lord of\NDarkness is gone? Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this even bigger shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't forget to thank the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean... A Tem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take a while to\Nget used to that. How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,After all these years, we\Nfinally know your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what's next, you know,\Nnow that you saved the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for the next bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Atem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There will not be another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have conquered the embodiment of pure\Ndarkness from which all evil is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but you are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With the help of your friends,\Nyou've nearly fulfilled your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why your spirit returned\Nto this world after 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So you could rescue\Nmankind once again from
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the inevitable return of the Shadow Games.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,there's but one task\Nleft for you to carry out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,before your spirit may\Nreturn to its resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that my\Njourney is almost complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean after I accomplish my\Nfinal mission, Yugi and I will separate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally feel like my own person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I solved the Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the pharaoh's been sharing\Nan identity with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that he's regained his lost\Nmemories, he's ready to be himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.25,0:16:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Te 'a, thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have defeated Zork without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Had it not been for your help, I\Ncould never have fulfilled my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I am forever in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.27,0:16:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now that you mention\Nit, I was brave. So thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He was talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.99,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm pretty\Nsure he meant everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we're a team, right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you geeks gonna stop\Ngiving that lame friendship speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.95,0:17:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say when you stop pretending\Neverything's a magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't deny this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, how do you explain the fact\Nthat there's two Yugi's standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there is some truth to this junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, did you hear what I heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.99,0:17:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba just admitted this\Nis all real. Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I said this was all a mind trick. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys heard him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to pick up the pieces and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have the city rebuilt in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not going to be easy, but this\Nkingdom shall return to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.35,0:17:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will see to it that\Nthis occurs, Seto. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be leaving this world, and\Nyou will be taking the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,for you are now king of Egypt. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I... but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So let it be written, so let it be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But after everything we've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.99,0:18:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,this kingdom needs a strong\Nleader to move us ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And who better to lead\Nthis nation than you, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no memories beyond\Nthis point. So I can
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,no longer exist here\NMy time is running out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, King Seto Pharaoh,\Nare you alright? Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will soon join the pharaohs that\Ncame before me And you shall rebuild
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of Egypt Trust the light\Nin your soul The light in my soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I leave you this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As proof of your right to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,please preserve my father's dream\Nand maintain peace in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you who is now king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this? I am. Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.05,0:19:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's hit the high road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.51,0:19:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my Pharaoh.
